---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import FeatureCard from '../../components/FeatureCard.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="CRM Data Quality for RevOps: The Complete Guide (2025)"
  description="How RevOps teams can improve CRM data quality with automated cleaning rules, real-time alerts, and one-click fixes. Stop data decay before it kills your forecast."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="gradient-hero py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-white/90 text-sm mb-6">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
          RevOps Guide
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
          CRM Data Quality for RevOps Teams
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          60% of CRM data decays annually. Learn how to automate data hygiene, catch issues in real-time, and fix problems with one click.
        </p>
        <Button href="/trial" variant="primary" size="lg">
          Try Automated Cleaning Rules
        </Button>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-4">14-day free trial. No credit card required.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Problem Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          The CRM Data Quality Crisis
        </h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">
          <div class="text-center p-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-red-600">60%</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">of CRM data decays every year</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-red-600">30%</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">of close dates are inaccurate</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-red-600">$15M</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">annual cost of bad data (avg.)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-red-600">79%</div>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">of sales data never enters CRM</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-4" style="color: #061A35;">Why This Matters for RevOps</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
              <span><strong>Inaccurate forecasts:</strong> 56% of sales forecasts miss the mark because of bad data</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
              <span><strong>Wasted time:</strong> Sales managers spend 12+ hours/week on forecast prep instead of coaching</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
              <span><strong>Missed opportunities:</strong> Stale deals slip through the cracks, renewals get forgotten</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
              <span><strong>Lost trust:</strong> Leadership can't trust the numbers, so they build shadow spreadsheets</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Traditional vs Modern -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Traditional vs. Modern Data Hygiene
        </h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#666" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold" style="color: #061A35;">The Old Way</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
                <span>Manual spreadsheet audits (weekly or monthly)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
                <span>Export data, find issues, email reps to fix</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
                <span>Issues pile up between audits</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
                <span>Reps ignore email requests</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-red-500 mt-1">&#10005;</span>
                <span>RevOps becomes the "data police"</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#061A35] to-[#0A2342] rounded-xl p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">The Pyko Way</h3>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-200">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-400 mt-1">&#10003;</span>
                <span>Automated cleaning rules run on schedule</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-400 mt-1">&#10003;</span>
                <span>Issues detected and alerted in real-time</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-400 mt-1">&#10003;</span>
                <span>Alerts go directly to the responsible rep</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-400 mt-1">&#10003;</span>
                <span>One-click fixes in Slack/Teams</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="text-green-400 mt-1">&#10003;</span>
                <span>RevOps tracks metrics, not individual records</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Common Issues -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Common CRM Data Quality Issues
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 text-center mb-12">
          These are the issues Pyko's Cleaning Rules detect automatically.
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-yellow-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#CA8A04" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Stale Close Dates</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Deals with close dates in the past that haven't been updated. These destroy forecast accuracy.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Example rule: "Alert when close date is in the past and stage is not Closed"</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#DC2626" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Missing Required Fields</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Opportunities missing critical data like next steps, MEDDIC fields, or contact info.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Example rule: "Alert when Amount > $50K and Champion field is empty"</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#EA580C" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Stalled Deals</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Opportunities that haven't moved stages in 14+ days. These need attention or should be closed.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Example rule: "Alert when stage unchanged for 14 days and not in Closed"</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9333EA" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Inactive Owner</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Records assigned to users who've left the company or changed roles.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Example rule: "Alert when owner is inactive and deal is open"</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2563EB" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Slipping Close Dates</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Deals where the close date keeps getting pushed. A pattern that predicts lost deals.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Example rule: "Alert when close date pushed 3+ times"</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#16A34A" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" style="color: #061A35;">Zero Amount Deals</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Opportunities in late stages with no amount entered. Can't forecast what you can't measure.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Example rule: "Alert when stage is Negotiation and Amount is 0"</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How Pyko Works -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#061A35] to-[#0A2342]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            How Pyko's Cleaning Rules Work
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
            Set it once, catch issues forever.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white text-2xl font-bold">1</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Define Your Rules</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Use templates or create custom rules. No code required. Set schedule (daily, hourly, etc.)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white text-2xl font-bold">2</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Automatic Detection</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Pyko scans your CRM on schedule and identifies records that match your criteria.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white text-2xl font-bold">3</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Alert + Quick Fix</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Reps get notified with full context and can fix the issue with one click in Slack/Teams.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sample Alert -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F94730] to-[#D83820] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v4"/><path d="m6.8 14-3.5 2"/><path d="m20.7 16-3.5-2"/><path d="M6.8 10 3.3 8"/><path d="m20.7 8-3.5 2"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <span class="font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Pyko</span>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Cleaning Rule Alert</span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 mb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#CA8A04" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
                  <span class="font-semibold text-yellow-800">Stale Close Date</span>
                </div>
                <p class="font-medium mb-1" style="color: #061A35;">Acme Corp - Enterprise Deal</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2">Close date was Nov 15, 2024 but deal is still in "Proposal" stage</p>
                <div class="flex gap-4 text-xs text-gray-500">
                  <span>Amount: $125,000</span>
                  <span>Days overdue: 26</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-2">
                <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium bg-[#F94730] text-white">
                  Push to Dec 31
                </button>
                <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">
                  Mark Closed Lost
                </button>
                <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 border border-gray-200">
                  View in CRM
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Results -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Results RevOps Teams Achieve
        </h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
          <div class="text-center p-8 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-5xl font-bold mb-2 text-green-600">90%</div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Close date accuracy (up from 60%)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-8 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-5xl font-bold mb-2 text-green-600">5h</div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Saved per manager per week on forecast prep</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-8 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
            <div class="text-5xl font-bold mb-2 text-green-600">40%</div>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Reduction in stale pipeline</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl">
          <blockquote class="text-lg text-gray-700 italic mb-4">
            "Before Pyko, we spent half our time chasing reps to update their deals. Now the system does it automatically. Our forecast accuracy went from 'educated guess' to something leadership actually trusts."
          </blockquote>
          <p class="font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">— RevOps Manager, Series B SaaS Company</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Getting Started -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Get Started in 5 Minutes
        </h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white font-bold">1</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Connect CRM</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Salesforce or HubSpot via OAuth</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white font-bold">2</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Connect Slack/Teams</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Install the Pyko app</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white font-bold">3</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Choose Templates</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Or create custom rules</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#F94730] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white font-bold">4</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Set Schedule</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Daily, hourly, or custom</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" style="color: #061A35;">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">How is this different from native CRM reports?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Native reports show you the data, but don't push alerts to the right people at the right time. Pyko proactively notifies record owners in Slack/Teams and gives them one-click actions to fix issues immediately.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Does Pyko modify CRM data automatically?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">No. Pyko detects and alerts, but changes only happen when a user clicks an action button. You stay in control of all data modifications.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Can I create custom cleaning rules?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">Yes. Pyko's no-code builder lets you create rules based on any field or combination of fields. Use filters like "where Amount > $50K AND Next Step is empty AND Stage = Negotiation."</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">How often do cleaning rules run?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700">You set the schedule. Options include hourly, daily, weekly, or custom cron expressions. Most teams run data hygiene checks daily.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2" style="color: #061A35;">Does Pyko work with both Salesforce and HubSpot?</h3>
